//　おまえはどちらでもなかろう？》
《If anyone has the right to condemn us, it is the saint who has never touched a weapon, or the man who feels no shame in deceit. But you are neither. Are you?》

pt:
//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md05/0270220a14'>
